# Firebender Ascension: "Whenever a creature you control attacking causes a triggered ability of that creature to trigger, put a quest
# counter on this enchantment. Then if it has four or more quest counters on it, you may copy that ability." Turn 1 Bot1 makes seven mana
# and casts the Ascension (its Soldier token) and Cruel Administrator, whose attack trigger makes a Soldier. Turn 3: the Administrator and
# the first Soldier attack, each causing its own ability to trigger (two counters; the Administrator's makes the second Soldier). Turns 5 and 7
# the Administrator attacks alone: the third counter and then the fourth. The fourth is offered the copy, and the copy of the Administrator's
# trigger makes a second token of its own: five Soldiers, not four.

